Id: cry002w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_crypto
Fix: chmod 600 the key, owned by root (or group ssl-cert).
References: openssl(1)
Controls: CIS 3.3; NIST AC-3, SC-12; ISO 8.3, 8.24; CE User access control

A private key is readable by strangers: whoever copies it
decrypts and impersonates. Leave keys readable by root alone
(the ssl-cert group excepted, which reads keys by design).
